{{!
    @template mod_interactivevideo/player/startscreenpage

    The start screen on its own in a 16:9 frame. No video loads on this page:
    mod_interactivevideo/launch opens it in a full-viewport popup on play.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * cmid - Course module id.
    * courseid - Course id.
    * contextid - Module context id.
    * title - Activity name.
    * posterimage - Poster image url.
    * startscreenonly - Shows the play button without waiting for a player.

    Example context (json):
    {
        "cmid": 12,
        "courseid": 3,
        "contextid": 45,
        "title": "Cell structure basics",
        "posterimage": "https://example.com/poster.jpg",
        "startscreenonly": true
    }
}}
<div id="interactivevideo-startframe"
     class="position-relative overflow-hidden"
     data-id="{{cmid}}"
     data-course="{{courseid}}"
     data-contextid="{{contextid}}">
    {{> mod_interactivevideo/player/startscreen}}
</div>
